Source: sysible-desktop-gnome
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sysible <maintainers@sysible.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://sysible.com
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: sysible-desktop-gnome
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, sysible-artwork, dconf-gsettings-backend
Recommends: gnome-core, systerm
Description: Sysible Workstation GNOME desktop defaults
 Sets the out-of-the-box GNOME look for Sysible Workstation: Mesh (Dark) as the default
 wallpaper and lock screen, dark colour scheme, the blue brand accent, SysTerm as
 the default terminal, and a sensible favourites bar. Ships as gschema default
 overrides, so every setting stays user-changeable.
